===Etymology===
{{PIE root|ang|swep}}
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*swefnaz||sleep, dream}}, from {{inh|ang|ine-pro|*swépnos}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|sweƀan}}, {{cog|non|svefn}}. The [[w:Proto-Indo-European language|Indo-European]] root also led to {{cog|grc|ὕπνος}}, {{cog|la|somnus}}, {{cog|sga|suan}}, {{cog|cu|сънъ}}, {{cog|ru|сон}}, {{cog|lt|sãpnas}}.

